@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Viewing recorded meals: view-meals
autonumber

participant "MishMash" as App
participant "cmd:\nViewMealsCommand" as Cmd
participant "mealLog: MealLog" as Log
participant "viewer:\nMealLogViewer" as Viewer
participant "MacroSplit" as Split

note over App, Cmd
  Parsing mirrors record-meal: Parser accepts no arguments
  and creates ViewMealsCommand(mealLog). It is omitted here.
end note

App -> Cmd : execute(recipeBook)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Log : getMeals()
Log --> Cmd : meals
alt meals is empty
  Cmd --> App : "No meals recorded yet."
else at least one meal
  Cmd -> Log : getTotals()
  Log --> Cmd : totals: NutritionTotals
  create Viewer
  Cmd -> Viewer : new MealLogViewer()
  Cmd -> Viewer : view(meals, totals)
  loop for each meal
    Viewer -> Split : of(meal)
    Split --> Viewer : Optional<MacroSplit>
  end
  Viewer --> Cmd : formatted text
  Cmd --> App : each meal's calories, macros\nand macro split, then the totals
end
deactivate Cmd
note over App, Log
  No model data is changed. RecipeBook is not read by this command.
end note
@enduml
